# Theme color

ECLBET (`eclbet04.com`) is a **structure / copy / chrome-behavior** reference. Color always comes from [`design-system/tokens.css`](design-system/tokens.css).

- Dark `--color-primary` is **gold** (`#edc34a`): Join, selected, hover bars, scroll thumbs, “go” states.
- Light `--color-primary` is the same gold family, darker for paper surfaces.
- Surfaces, text, and borders use `--color-surface`, `--color-text-secondary`, `--color-text-muted`, `--color-border`.
- Do not hard-code `#2d2e30`, `#333435`, `#b2b2b2`, `#202023`, or Rubik-as-brand-color. Do not paste operator hex into CSS; change the token instead.

```css
/* BAD */
.site-sidebar { background: #2d2e30; }
.selected { color: #fabb2e; }

/* GOOD */
.site-sidebar { background: var(--color-surface); }
.selected { color: var(--color-primary); }
```

